# Use the HTTPS endpoint from `aspire describe` and your HTTP client's authenticated cookie jar.
@host = https://ingacookbook.dev.localhost:REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_PORT
@recipeId = REPLACE_WITH_RECIPE_ID
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_AUTHENTICATED_GET

### Development schema
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Obtain a token before mutations; retain the antiforgery cookie.
GET {{host}}/api/notebook/token

### Current workspace
GET {{host}}/api/notebook/workspace

### Create a workspace
POST {{host}}/api/notebook/workspace
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{token}}

{"name":"My test kitchen","currency":"USD"}

### Start a recipe with an initial draft
POST {{host}}/api/notebook/recipes
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{token}}

{"name":"Vanilla","description":"Smooth and scoopable","metrics":["Flavor","Texture"]}

### Get revision, versions, metric IDs, batches, and evaluations
GET {{host}}/api/notebook/recipes/{{recipeId}}
